                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A no-frills puzzle platformer where the goal of each level is to get your character to the door. There are various obstacles each level, ranging from disappearing platforms to stationary spikes and moving razors. \n\nWhat differentiates this game from other platformers is its rather creative use of \"freezing\" your character into ice blocks that you can step on to help you reach your goal. You get a limited number of \"freezes\" per level, so some thought is required on how to use them. Graphics and animation are very basic, but at least your character makes an astonished face when he is falling! \n\nRecommended if you like puzzle platformers that involve strategy and some degree of skill and reflexes.",
